---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = '23 November 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Terms, payments and refunds | JayTech9"
  description="How JayTech9 quotes, takes payment, delivers work, handles revisions, cancellations and refunds, and who owns the finished work."
>
  <article>
    <header class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Terms, payments and <em class="hl">refunds</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">The simple rules we work by, so you know exactly what to expect.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="wrap section post-body overlap sheet">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> {updated}</p>
        <p>
          These terms apply to services and products from {site.legalName} (“JayTech9”, “we”), {site.city},
          {site.country}. A written quote or agreement for your project can add to them; where the two differ, the
          quote or agreement applies.
        </p>

        <h2 id="quotes">Quotes</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Every job starts with a written quote showing the work, the price, the timeline and the payment split.</li>
          <li>Prices are in Ghana cedis (GH₵) unless the quote says another currency.</li>
          <li>A quote is valid for 14 days.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="payments">Payments</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Deposit:</strong> 70% of the quoted price is paid before work starts. Work begins once the deposit
            and all the materials we need from you (text, pictures, logos, access) have arrived.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Balance:</strong> the remaining 30% is paid when the work is delivered. We send a preview first;
            the final files, code and logins are handed over once the balance is paid.
          </li>
          <li>Larger projects may be paid 50% at the start and 50% on approval, or in stages (milestones). The quote will say so.</li>
          <li>You can pay online through Paystack by Mobile Money or card, or by bank transfer to our CalBank account (shown on your order page), using your order number as the reference. We never see or store your card or Mobile Money PIN.</li>
          <li>
            You can pay by mobile money or card through Paystack, our secure payment provider, or by bank or
            mobile money transfer. We never ask for your card details by phone, WhatsApp or email.
          </li>
          <li>Hosting, care plans and subscriptions are paid in advance for each period (monthly or yearly).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="delivery">Delivery and revisions</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>We deliver by the date in your quote, counted from when the deposit and your materials have arrived.</li>
          <li><strong>On time or 10% off:</strong> if your first preview reaches you after the due date, we take 10% off the balance. This does not apply when the delay comes from late materials, feedback or approval, or changes to the brief.</li>
          <li>You can follow every step, pay and approve on your private order page. Keep its link private.</li>
          <li>Each job includes two rounds of changes, unless the quote says otherwise. Further changes are quoted separately.</li>
          <li>If you need extra time to send materials or feedback, the delivery date moves by the same amount.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="refunds">Cancellations and refunds</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Before work starts:</strong> cancel and we refund your deposit in full.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>After work starts:</strong> the deposit covers the work already done and is not refundable. If
            you cancel, you receive the work completed so far.
          </li>
          <li><strong>If we can’t deliver</strong> what was agreed, we refund everything you have paid for that job.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Domains and third-party services</strong> (such as domain registration or paid plugins) can’t be
            refunded once bought in your name.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Hosting and care plans:</strong> cancel any time; the plan stops at the end of the period you’ve paid for.</li>
          <li><strong>Donations</strong> are not refundable, except for duplicate or mistaken payments.</li>
          <li>
            Approved refunds are paid back to the original payment method within 10 working days. To ask for a
            refund, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with your name and payment reference.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="ownership">Ownership</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Once the job is paid in full, you own what we made for you: the designs, videos, code, data and
            logins. Domains are registered in your name.
          </li>
          <li>
            We may show the finished work in our portfolio. Tell us if you’d rather we didn’t, and we won’t.
          </li>
          <li>
            You confirm that you have the right to use the text, pictures, music, logos and other materials you send
            us.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="responsibility">Our responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          We do careful, professional work and fix our own mistakes free of charge. Our total responsibility for any
          job is limited to the amount you paid for that job.
        </p>

        <h2 id="privacy">Your information</h2>
        <p>
          How we handle personal details is explained in our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 id="law">Law and contact</h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of Ghana. Questions or problems: email
          <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, call or WhatsApp
          <a href={site.whatsapp}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>. We aim to resolve any concern within 5 working days.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
